  m_name: Under 'Neath (Adds 50 Relics, 10 Curses and 5 Blessings!)
  m_description: "[h1] Under 'Neath The First UnderMine 2 Content Pack! [/h1]   
    [b]Under 'Neath[/b] is content mod pack for UnderMine 2 adding new relics, blessings,
    curses and hopefully a whole lot more coming soon! UnderMine 2 has some really
    powerful modding tools and I wanted to explore what i could do with them, here
    are some of the cool things I've managed to make so far!    Make sure to [b]enable
    mods[/b] on your UnderMine 2 profile, this can be done when selecting your profile!  
    [h2] Features [/h2]  [list] [*] 50 Brand new relics to find! [*] 10 New curses
    to add a little trouble! [*] 5 New blessings to help you in the mines! [*] A
    whole new room in the Hub to customise the game's difficulty to your liking!
    [*] Full Chinese and German translations! [/list]  [h2] Credits [/h2]  [list]
    [*] [b]Nevernamed[/b] for creating the sprites! [*] [b]PumBa \u21162[/b] for
    helping and answering questions. [*] [b]The Thorium devs[/b] for making the modding
    tools and helping with issues!  [/list]"
  m_tags: undermine,undermine2
